  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "MZ단인가.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D005AB2E8C778AC00002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "녹청파 사이에서 제법 유명하거든.\n너, 강하다며?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B179CCADD30C0020C0ACC774C5D0C11C0020C81CBC950020C720BA85D558AC70B4E0002E000AB108002C0020AC15D558B2E4BA70003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮다면 나랑 승부하지 않겠어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD1CCC2EB2E4BA740020B098B7910020C2B9BD80D558C9C00020C54AACA0C5B4003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해 줄 거라면\n내게 말을 걸도록 하라고, MZ단.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D5740020C9040020AC70B77CBA74000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78B3C4B85D0020D558B77CACE0002C0020004D005AB2E8002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부할 마음이 들었나 보네.\n바로 시작할까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D5600020B9C8C74CC7740020B4E4C5C8B0980020BCF4B124002E000ABC14B85C0020C2DCC791D560AE4C003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나의 강철같이 단단한\n신념을 보여 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C7580020AC15CCA0AC19C7740020B2E8B2E8D55C000AC2E0B150C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCACA0C5B40021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐야 진짜, 승부할 준비가 안 됐으면\n말을 걸지 말았어야지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50C57C0020C9C4C9DC002C0020C2B9BD80D5600020C900BE44AC000020C5480020B410C73CBA74000AB9D0C7440020AC78C9C00020B9D0C558C5B4C57CC9C0002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너는 참\n친화력이 대단한 것 같단 말이지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B2940020CC38000ACE5CD654B825C7740020B300B2E8D55C0020AC830020AC19B2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아, 승부에서 졌으니\n내가 흥미로운 이야기를 하나 들려주겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544002C0020C2B9BD80C5D0C11C0020C84CC73CB2C8000AB0B4AC000020D765BBF8B85CC6B40020C774C57CAE30B97C0020D558B0980020B4E4B824C8FCACA0C5B4002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이름하여\n강철은 독에 물들지 않는다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B984D558C5EC000AAC15CCA0C7400020B3C5C5D00020BB3CB4E4C9C00020C54AB294B2E40021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "젊은 시절의 지프 씨는 자신보다 훨씬 어린\n카라스바 씨에게 매료됐었다는 모양이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C80AC7400020C2DCC808C7580020C9C0D5040020C528B2940020C790C2E0BCF4B2E40020D6E8C52C0020C5B4B9B0000ACE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528C5D0AC8C0020B9E4B8CCB410C5C8B2E4B2940020BAA8C591C774C57C002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 카라스바 씨에게는\n뭔가 독 같은 느낌이 있잖아!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n상대를 매료시키면서도\n자신에게까지 해를 입히는 독 말이야...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528C5D0AC8CB294000ABB54AC000020B3C50020AC19C7400020B290B08CC7740020C788C796C544002100100001BE01000AC0C1B300B97C0020B9E4B8CCC2DCD0A4BA74C11CB3C4000AC790C2E0C5D0AC8CAE4CC9C00020D574B97C0020C785D788B2940020B3C50020B9D0C774C57C002E002E002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 지프 씨는 무장조와 포켓몬들을 보며\n카라스바 씨의 독에 너무 깊이 빠지지 않게<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n마음을 다잡고 있대.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C9C0D5040020C528B2940020BB34C7A5C870C6400020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7440020BCF4BA70000ACE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528C7580020B3C5C5D00020B108BB340020AE4AC7740020BE60C9C0C9C00020C54AAC8C00100001BE00000AB9C8C74CC7440020B2E4C7A1ACE00020C788B300002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시답잖은 이야기지만 제법 흥미로웠지?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n회사의 넘버 2가 그런 마음가짐이라면\n우리 같은 아랫것들도 안심이 된단 말이지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCB2F5C796C7400020C774C57CAE30C9C0B9CC0020C81CBC950020D765BBF8B85CC6E0C9C0003F00100001BE01000AD68CC0ACC7580020B118BC8400200032AC000020ADF8B7F00020B9C8C74CAC00C9D0C774B77CBA74000AC6B0B9AC0020AC19C7400020C544B7ABAC83B4E4B3C40020C548C2ECC7740020B41CB2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이건 진지하게 승부해 준 데다\n시답잖은 이야기까지 들어 준 답례야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC740020C9C4C9C0D558AC8C0020C2B9BD80D5740020C9000020B370B2E4000AC2DCB2F5C796C7400020C774C57CAE30AE4CC9C00020B4E4C5B40020C9000020B2F5B840C57C002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앞으로도 잘 부탁한다.\n카라스바 씨의 부하, MZ단!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C55EC73CB85CB3C40020C7980020BD80D0C1D55CB2E4002E000ACE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528C7580020BD80D558002C0020004D005AB2E80021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앞으로도 잘 부탁한다.\n카라스바 씨의 부하, MZ단!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
